  <div class="section-header  justify-self-center text-center"><div class="prose"><h2 class="h2 custom-heading  ">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div></div><div class="faq"><div class="faq__content"><accordion-disclosure class="accordion custom-faq-accordion  " >
  <details
    class="accordion__disclosure group"
    
      aria-expanded="false"
    
  >
    <summary><span class="accordion__toggle text-lg custom-accordion-css"><span>Why do I need a cleaning brush?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" width="10" class="group-expanded:rotate icon icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 10 10">
      <path d="m1 3 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square"/>
    </svg></span>
    </summary>

    <div class="accordion__content custom-accordion-css "><div class="prose"><p>A cleaning brush helps clean the inside of your copper bottle properly, removes buildup, and keeps it hygienic and shiny for daily use.</p></div></div>
  </details>
</accordion-disclosure>
<accordion-disclosure class="accordion custom-faq-accordion  " >
  <details
    class="accordion__disclosure group"
    
      aria-expanded="false"
    
  >
    <summary><span class="accordion__toggle text-lg custom-accordion-css"><span>Can I use the bottle without these accessories?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" width="10" class="group-expanded:rotate icon icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 10 10">
      <path d="m1 3 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square"/>
    </svg></span>
    </summary>

    <div class="accordion__content custom-accordion-css "><div class="prose"><p>Yes, the copper bottle can be used without these accessories, but they help make cleaning, carrying, and daily use more convenient.</p></div></div>
  </details>
</accordion-disclosure>
<accordion-disclosure class="accordion custom-faq-accordion  " >
  <details
    class="accordion__disclosure group"
    
      aria-expanded="false"
    
  >
    <summary><span class="accordion__toggle text-lg custom-accordion-css"><span>How does it work?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" width="10" class="group-expanded:rotate icon icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 10 10">
      <path d="m1 3 4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square"/>
    </svg></span>
    </summary>

    <div class="accordion__content custom-accordion-css "><div class="prose"><p>Copper naturally has antimicrobial properties that help keep water fresh. When water is stored in the bottle for a few hours, it absorbs trace benefits of copper, making it a healthier way to stay hydrated.</p></div></div>
  </details>
</accordion-disclosure>
<accordion-disclosure class="accordion custom-faq-accordion  " >
  <details
    class="accordion__disclosure group"
    
      aria-expanded="false"
    
  >
    <summary><span class="accordion__toggle text-lg custom-accordion-css"><span>Will it rust</span><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" fill="none" width="10" class="group-expanded:rotate icon icon-chevron-down" viewBox="0 0 10 10">
